WEBVTT

00:03:59.101 --> 00:04:00.949
Gandhi had a high AQ score.

00:04:00.973 --> 00:04:02.125
(Laughter)

00:04:02.149 --> 00:04:03.458
The third and final trick

00:04:03.482 --> 00:04:06.149
that I use to assess
a founder's adaptability

00:04:06.173 --> 00:04:09.053
is to look for people
who infuse exploration

00:04:09.077 --> 00:04:11.315
into their life and their business.

00:04:11.638 --> 00:04:16.082
There's a sort of natural tension
between exploration and exploitation.

00:04:16.106 --> 00:04:17.360
And collectively,

00:04:17.384 --> 00:04:20.161
all of us tend to overvalue exploitation.

00:04:20.185 --> 00:04:21.452
Here's what I mean.

00:04:21.815 --> 00:04:23.363
In the year 2000,

00:04:23.387 --> 00:04:26.617
a man finagled his way
into a meeting with John Antioco,

00:04:26.641 --> 00:04:28.355
the CEO of Blockbuster,

00:04:28.379 --> 00:04:29.950
and proposed a partnership

00:04:29.974 --> 00:04:33.109
to manage Blockbuster's
fledgling online business.